	'messages:managewiki-header-extensions-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s extensions and skins from this panel but \'\'\'you do not have permission to manage them\'\'\'. If you need an extension or skin enabled, please contact this wiki\'s operators.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-namespaces' => 'en:You may manage this wiki\'s namespace settings from this panel. Some settings will only reflect once you enable an extension. Consult MediaWiki documenation for further information. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-namespaces-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s namespace settings from this panel but \'\'\'you do not have permission to change them\'\'\'. Contact wiki operators if you need further assistance.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-permissions' => 'en:You may manage this wiki\'s user group settings from this panel (such as permissions, group assignments and autopromotion). Please read the documentation very carefully and do not delete groups brazenly or your wiki may break. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds.

Not all permissions may be assignable. Certain user permissions may be reserved only for farm operators. Contact your farm if you do not find certain permissions.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-permissions-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s user group settings from this panel (such as permissions, group assignments and autopromotion) but \'\'\'you do not have permission to change them\'\'\'. Contact wiki operators if you need further assistance.',
	'messages:managewiki-header-settings' => 'en:You may manage this wiki\'s settings (such as logo, styling, and more) from this panel. Be careful! Make sure to carefully read setting descriptions and do not toggle random settings indiscriminately unless you understand what it does. Once done, click \'Save\' and your preferences will reflect in a few seconds. 

Greyed out options may only be changed by farm operators. You may manage core settings such as wiki name and language at [[Special:ManageWiki/core]].',
	'messages:managewiki-header-settings-view' => 'en:You may view this wiki\'s settings (such as logo, styling, and more) from this panel but \'\'\'you do not have permission to change them\'\'\'.

